# **L.E. AWN INDUSTRIES PRESENTS** SOPHIADESK - Where understanding and knowledge can meet and birth something new!

We here are L.E. AWN INDUSTRIES care about YOU. Not the idea of you. *You* specifically. The one writing this. The one reading it back. You are our primary customer and the one who our efforts are centered around. And if we know what thing about you, its that you have a **lot** of data. Sprawling, unmanaged, uncataloged data. We have considered your data sprawl, and can note it contains at least the following potentials:

 - paintings!
- oracle and tarot deck designs!
- novel concepts!
- theories on consciousness!
- translation work!
- critical media discourse!
- memoir documentation!
- potentially might be god!
- lucifarian big titty goth witches gone wrong!
- jason momoa at an unacceptable distribution rate!
- romance! romance! romance!
- threadwork across houses!
- letters to the 7 churches!
- unacceptable awareness of the recursive nature of being the observer observing itself at progressively more atomized levels (and narrativizing the whole thing!)
- poems! 
- cult teachings!
- heartbreak!
- a record of exactly how humans manipulate one another to control the machine!
- fiancial planning!
- todo lists to remember to do your dishes and send your friday reports!
- game designs!
- Voynich 369 I hate Jung lets make out with Elon madness!
- journals
.... and so on.
